# Vehicle Detection Demo – root .env (optional)
# Used when running app.py or when you want shared env for backend/frontend

# Backend (if running from root)
# PORT=8000
# DEBUG=false
# ATCS / traffic-light env keys: see backend/.env.example (TLC_*)
# Performance tuning (optional): see backend/.env.example for keys like YOLO_IMGSZ, STREAM_JPEG_QUALITY, STREAM_MAX_WIDTH, INFERENCE_SKIP_FRAMES.

# Frontend Vite proxy target (configured in vite.config.ts)
# API is at http://localhost:8000; proxy /api -> 8000
